can still feel frust",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg","children":"A good IPTV service can still feel frustrating on weak hardware. Menus take too long to respond, large programme guides stutter, and unstable Wi-Fi can turn live sport into a buffering loop. Google recommends at least 15 Mbps for 4K playback, but broadband speed only gets the stream to your device. The processor, memory, storage, and network connection still affect how quickly apps open, channels change, and playlists load."}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-slate-400","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"11 min read"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-slate-600","children":"•"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Updated ",["$","time",null,{"dateTime":"2026-08-04","children":"4 August 2026"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2","children":[["$","span","6 boxes compared",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"6 boxes compared"}],["$","span","Specs and UK availability",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"Specs and UK availability"}],["$","span","Honest drawbacks",{"className":"rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90","children":"Honest drawbacks"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 shadow-[0_35px_100px_-45px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/guides/android-tv-box.svg","alt":"Android TV box connected to a television showing a live channel grid","width":1200,"height":630,"className":"h-auto w-full","fetchPriority":"high"}]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-16","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_270px] lg:gap-14","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-w-0","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"This guide compares the best Android TV boxes for IPTV in the UK across premium, mid-range, and budget price levels. The comparison uses published hardware specifications, platform support, current UK availability, app compatibility, and the features that matter during everyday viewing."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":["Each review also explains the main drawback and the type of buyer the box suits. Honest drawbacks and a clear \"buy if\" recommendation make it easier to choose a box that suits your television, internet connection, and viewing habits without paying for features you will never use. Once you have picked one, our ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/installation-guide","className":"font-semibold text-orange-600 underline decoration-orange-300 underline-offset-2 transition hover:text-orange-700","children":"IPTV setup guide"}]," walks through installing a player on it."]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"quick-comparison","className":"mt-12 scroll-mt-24 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl","children":"Quick Comparison"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 sm:text-[17px] sm:leading-8","children":"The comparison uses official manufacturer specifications, software support records, current UK retailer availability, platform certification, storage, networking, remote controls, and built-in viewing features."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-500","children":"Prices and availability were checked on 2 August 2026 and may change."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-[0_20px_60px_-50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.6)]","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left text-sm","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"bg-slate-900 text-white","children":[["$","th","Android box",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"Android box"}],["$","th","Best for",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"Best for"}],["$","th","RAM",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"RAM"}],["$","th","Storage",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"Storage"}],["$","th","Ethernet",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"Ethernet"}],["$","th","Main drawback",{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]","children":"Main drawback"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","NVIDIA Shield TV Pro",{"className":"bg-white","children":[["$","td","NVIDIA Shield TV Pro-0",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 font-semibold text-slate-900","children":"NVIDIA Shield TV Pro"}],["$","td","NVIDIA Shield TV Pro-1",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Premium all-round use"}],["$","td","NVIDIA Shield TV Pro-2",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"3 GB"}],["$","td","NVIDIA Shield TV Pro-3",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"16 GB"}],["$","td","NVIDIA Shield TV Pro-4",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"Gigabit"}],["$","td","NVIDIA Shield TV Pro-5",{"className":"border-t border-slate-200 px-4 py-3 align-top leading-6 text-slate-600","children":"High price"}]]}],["$","tr","NVIDIA Shield TV",{"clas